# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Algorith Voice — Docker build context exclusions.
# Keep images small, reproducible, and secret-free.
# NOTE: `**/.env*` patterns are intentional: apps/backend/.env holds
# local dev secrets and must never leak into any image.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------

# Dependencies / build outputs
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
.next
**/.next
out
.turbo
**/.turbo
coverage
**/coverage
*.tsbuildinfo

# Version control / CI
.git
.gitignore
.github

# Environment & secrets — never bake into images.
# Compose / Fly inject these at runtime.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
secrets

# Local tooling / OS noise
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
npm-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# Desktop native artifacts (never part of server images)
src-tauri/target
apps/desktop/src-tauri/target
apps/desktop/dist
*.dmg
*.msi
*.AppImage
*.deb

# Docs / specs not needed at runtime
*-prompt.md
assets
